# The rendered website. Built by `make site`, published by
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml -- nothing reads it out of this repository.
#
# It used to be committed because GitHub Pages served it straight from
# master:/docs, which put ~130 MB and a 6 MB index.html diff in the history for
# every data change. Pages deploys via Actions now, so the tree here is a local
# build artefact like export/ is. Do not commit it back: Settings -> Pages ->
# Source is "GitHub Actions", and the legacy branch builder that would have used
# this directory is disarmed.
docs/
